READ: "model gain" is how much the network buys over the best single-pixel colour cue.
A LARGE gain means texture and context dominate and the colour instability found in it.72/75
matters less than feared. The two correlations say which cue the model RESEMBLES - but
resemblance is not causation, and only a channel ablation on the trained net settles Q98.
